{
  "_comment": [
    "Template for the gate-level klt functional-verification request, rendered",
    "by core_flow_gate_render() into flow/build/aes/gate-<testcase>/request.json.",
    "Not a request itself: @NETLIST@ is the per-run netlist `klt synthesize`",
    "wrote (read from that run's own report, hash-verified), so it cannot be a",
    "committed constant. @PRIMITIVES@/@CELL_LIB@ are the PDK's behavioural cell",
    "models, @BENCH_DIR@ this directory, @TESTCASE@ the cocotb testcase.",
    "",
    "The cell models come first and the netlist last: the netlist instantiates",
    "them. FUNCTIONAL selects the PDK's zero-delay behavioural models over its",
    "`specify` timing models, which Icarus cannot simulate (it implements",
    "neither $setuphold nor $recrem's delayed-signal outputs, so those models",
    "simulate as all-x); UNIT_DELAY keeps each flop's output off the clock edge",
    "that produced it. Both are passed through options.defines, which the",
    "pinned klt forwards to cocotb natively -- this flow is NOT a caller of",
    "verification/gate-level/common/sky130_fd_sc_hd_sim_defines.v.",
    "",
    "No options.sdf: this is a pre-layout netlist with no delays to annotate,",
    "and klt rejects options.sdf together with FUNCTIONAL outright. The",
    "SDF-annotated post-route run is issue #82."
  ],
  "schema": "klt.functional_verification.request/1",
  "engine": "icarus",
  "sources": [
    "@PRIMITIVES@",
    "@CELL_LIB@",
    "@NETLIST@"
  ],
  "hdl_toplevel": "aes_core",
  "testbench": {
    "module": "test_aes_core",
    "testcase": "@TESTCASE@",
    "search_path": "@BENCH_DIR@"
  },
  "options": {
    "coverage": false,
    "timescale": ["1ns", "1ps"],
    "random_seed": 1,
    "defines": {
      "FUNCTIONAL": null,
      "UNIT_DELAY": "#1"
    }
  }
}
